// The first handover already records this same day. The calendar is personal,
// and a saved receipt prevents duplicate payment after cancellation or reload.
<<if progress_value("story.s1.allowance.last-paid-day") >= game_day()>>
    <<pass_trigger>>
<<endif>>
Ryo Hazuki: Ine-san left my allowance on the shoe cabinet. #speaker:AKIR
<<record_game_day "story.s1.allowance.last-paid-day">>
<<grant_yen 500 "Ine-san's daily allowance">>
<<complete>>
